{"text":"purananuru","n":147,"lines":["கல்முழை அருவிப் பன்மலை நீந்திச்","சீறியாழ் செவ்வழி பண்ணி வந்ததைக்","கார்வான் இன்னுறை தமியள் கேளா","நெருநல் ஒருசிறைப் புலம்புகொண்டு உறையும்","அரிமதர் மழைக்கண் அம்மா அரிவை","நெய்யடு துறந்த மையிருங் கூந்தல்","மண்ணூறு மணியின் மாசுஅற மண்ணிப்","புதுமலர் கஞல இன்று பெயரின்","அதுமன் எம் பரிசில் ஆவியர் கோவே"],"tr":["kalmuḻai aruvip paṉmalai nīntic","cīṟiyāḻ cevvaḻi paṇṇi vantataik","kārvāṉ iṉṉuṟai tamiyaḷ kēḷā","nerunal oruciṟaip pulampukoṇṭu uṟaiyum","arimatar maḻaikkaṇ ammā arivai","neyyaṭu tuṟanta maiyiruṅ kūntal","maṇṇūṟu maṇiyiṉ mācuaṟa maṇṇip","putumalar kañala iṉṟu peyariṉ","atumaṉ em paricil āviyar kōvē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"peruntiṇai","tinai_ta":"பெருந்திணை","turai_ta":"குறுங்கலி","poet_ta":"பெருங்குன்றூர் கிழார்","addressed_ta":"வையாவிக் கோப்பெரும் பேகன்","poet_tr":"Peruṅkuṉṟūr Kiḻār"},"scan":{"meter":"nilaimaṇṭila āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"9 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"9×4 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 36"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 19, veṇṭaḷai 16"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கல்முழை","tr":"kalmuḻai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கல்","tr":"kal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"முழை","tr":"muḻai"}]},{"text":"யருவிப்","tr":"yaruvip","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யரு","tr":"yaru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"விப்","tr":"vip"}]},{"text":"பன்மலை","tr":"paṉmalai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பன்","tr":"paṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மலை","tr":"malai"}]},{"text":"நீந்திச்","tr":"nīntic","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீந்","tr":"nīn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"திச்","tr":"tic"}]}],[{"text":"சீறியாழ்","tr":"cīṟiyāḻ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சீ","tr":"cī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றியாழ்","tr":"ṟiyāḻ"}]},{"text":"செவ்வழி","tr":"cevvaḻi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செவ்","tr":"